    "Saintgits College of Engineering – Saintgits Group of Institutions\n3s\n3s\n3s\n3s\n3s\n3s\n3s\n3s\n3s\n3s\n3s\n3s\nDiscover The Campus\n3s\n3s\nLatest News\nAICTE ATAL (Offline mode) sponsored Six-Day Faculty Development Program (FDP) on “AI in power converters for sustainable energy systems,” from 5th January to 10th January, 2026 by Department of Electrical and Electronics Engineering, Saintgits.\nSaintgits faculty members dominated the All Kerala – Art of Teaching Competition organised by APJ Abdul Kalam Technological University. Bagged 4 out of 12 titles!\nASCE Saintgits Student Chapter bagged Third Prize at ASCE National Concrete Canoe Competition, hosted by Punjab Engineering College, Chandigarh.\nRs. 76,720 CERD fund Sanctioned for Students’ Projects.\nASCE Saintgits Team represented India at the ASCE Society-wide finals of Sustainable Solutions, hosted by Lousiana Tech University, Ruston, USA.\nSaintgits wins the prestigious IDA – STEM Award for Community Development.\nSaintgits College of Engineering\nABOUT THE INSTITUTION\nFounded by a group of pioneering educators, we at Saintgits College of Engineering (Autonomous) seek to expose young minds to the world of technology and encourage all-round development of the mind. Our team of dedicated and caring faculty works with the student to reach academic excellence through a scientifically devised methodology. The high quality of our graduates, many of who have been university rank holders, and our distinctive results and placements are proof of the great distance we have travelled in 20 years. Saintgits College of Engineering has been granted Autonomous status by the University Grants Commission (UGC), making the institution one among the first three Engineering Colleges in Kerala to achieve this coveted status. The status was conferred in recognition of the academic excellence, expert faculty, industry connect, placement records, extracurricular activities and state of the art infrastructure offered by the institution. Saintgits is now the only Autonomous Institution in Kerala with 9 NBA accredited programmes.\nSaintgits College of Engineering, right from inception, has been maintaining high levels of standards in academic and extra-curricular realms of activities.\nWe offer 10 B. Tech. Degree programmes, Integrated MCA, Integrated MBA, MBA with Specialization(Logistics and Supply Chain Management), 7 M. Tech. programmes, Master of Computer Applications (MCA), Master of Business Administration (MBA)\n& 3 Bachelor of Design (B.Des) Programs\n. The college is also the venue of national and state-level seminars and symposiums and has emerged as the hub of technical education in Kerala.\nAdmission Open\nB. Tech., M. Tech. & PhD\nApply Now\nExam Results\nNews & Events\nLearn about the latest news and current happenings at Saintgits College of Engineering.\nKnow more\nSaintgits Edge\nAnsys Campus\nKnow More\nIoT LAB\nKnow More\nFab Lab\nKnow More\nSCIE\nKnow More\nVIRTUAL LAB\nKnow More\nTestimonials\nMs Aleena Joseph\nUS FOODS, USA\nJust a few words about Saintgits… it really is one of the best colleges out there. The teachers were so helpful to me, whenever there was anything I needed or didn’t understand they were always there without delay. They made me feel right at home. By the end of the three years I would have considered my teachers to be friends.\nMr Jomon George\nChief Technology Officer, RABITEC\nIt has been 3 wonderful years at Saintgits. Things could have been different if Saintgits had not nurtured us in all respects – developing a sense of leadership, building our courage to be in Corporate world and learning work ethics to name a few. Saintgits has always guided and encouraged students to take a right path in their own way. Thank you Saintgits!\nPlacements\nAdmissions – Enquire Now!\n♿\nHigh Contrast\nDyslexia-Friendly Font\nA+\nA-\nHighlight Links\nLarge Cursor\nLine Height\nText Spacing\nReset"
